# The Activity Lab — account scope

This workspace is **PhotoSphere production** only. Use the same accounts as **crypto-pay** (`~/Projects/crypto-pay`).

## Use in this repo

| Tool | Account / path |
|------|----------------|
| GitHub CLI / git push | `photospheremedia` (active `gh` account) |
| GitHub remote | `photospheremedia/the-activity-lab` |
| Vercel CLI / MCP | `photospheremedia` (when deployed) |

## Do not use here

- **Skullcandyxxx** — personal GitHub; not for this repo
- **Parent-folder MCPs** from `~/Projects/.cursor/mcp.json` (AWS, claude-flow) — disabled in `.cursor/mcp.json`

## Verify GitHub

```bash
gh auth status          # active account → photospheremedia
git remote -v           # origin → photospheremedia/the-activity-lab
git config user.name    # photospheremedia (this repo)
```

If push fails with Skullcandy permissions:

```bash
gh auth switch --user photospheremedia
gh auth setup-git
```

See `~/Projects/crypto-pay/docs/CURSOR_ACCOUNTS.md` for the full PhotoSphere vs Skullcandy map.
